{"id":"664502","name":"卤脱骨猪手","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664502/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪脚","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"潮汕卤汁料包","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪手让商家帮忙去了骨。","img":"images/664502/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪脚用绳子绑好定型后冷水下锅焯烫后再洗净。","img":"images/664502/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"卤汁调料包备用。","img":"images/664502/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将猪脚放入珐琅锅中。","img":"images/664502/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入卤水包。","img":"images/664502/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水和老抽。","img":"images/664502/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火煮开。","img":"images/664502/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮开后转小火。","img":"images/664502/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上煲1小时左右。","img":"images/664502/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"猪脚卤好后再浸泡一晚入味。","img":"images/664502/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"泡入味的猪脚用保鲜膜包好放入冰箱冷藏。","img":"images/664502/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将猪脚改刀切薄片即可。","img":"images/664502/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664502/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664502/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664502/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}